@archive 0086
@size 11

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GirlWizard
	"여기는 시로가네 루나의 집에 있는\n사이버 코어야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너 록맨 아니야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"루나와 그렇게 친하게\n지내 줘서 정말\n기뻐!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MsHertz
	"안녕!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 집은 언제나 잘 정돈돼 있어.\n전파의 바람도\n시원하게 통하고 말이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrHertz
	"알고 있었어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 사이버 코어는\n집의 평면도 같은 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"멋지지!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = TransportHertz
	"이건 좋은\n지름길이야. 급할 때\n정말 유용하지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MsHertz
	"전파 음성이 들려."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"  “델타75148”"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이렇게 말하고\n있어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 10 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"클럽 스트롱 “R”!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ClubStrong
	"너... 너 록맨이구나!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"어떻게 안 거야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ClubStrong
	"우리 “R” 네트워크라면 그\n정도 정보는 쉽게 알아낼\n수 있지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너는 제거 대상으로\n지정됐다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러니 네가 서 있는 이곳을\n무덤으로 만들어 주마."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"흥! 누가 묻히게 될지는\n두고 보면 알겠지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"너희는 대체 누구야! 그리고\n지구에서 뭘 하고 있는 거야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ClubStrong
	"우리 “R”은 주인님께서\n만드셨다. 주인님의 이름으로,"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"수집할 가치가 있는 행성을\n조사하고 있지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"수집한다고?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"행성을 빼앗아서\n너희 것으로 만들겠다는\n거야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"저 녀석은 자기가\n뭐라도 되는 줄 아나?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ClubStrong
	"*킥킥* 이 행성, 마음에 드는군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"주인님께서도 지금껏 정복한\n다른 행성들보다 이곳을\n더 마음에 들어 하실 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이곳을 발견한 건\n피난처를 찾아 도망쳐 온\n아스트로 허츠 덕분이지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"스바루! 설마 그 아스트로\n허츠가..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"그래, 브라더가 되어 달라며\n우리에게 도움을 청했던 녀석!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그렇다면 이 모든 사건의\n배후에 이 “R” 녀석들과 주인이"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"있다는 거네. 그렇다면 우리에게\n필요한 건 이 녀석들을"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"몽땅 박살 내서\n일석이조를 거두는\n것뿐이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 녀석을 삭제하고\n이 노이즈 웨이브의 끝까지\n가 보자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ClubStrong
	"*킥킥* 바보 같군.\n네놈에게 승산은 없다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"글쎄...\n그건 직접 확인해 보자고!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋아, 간다! 클럽 스트롱 “R”!\n웨이브 배틀!\n라이드 온!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	flagSet
		flag = 167
	end
}
